{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "scale-county-idle-species-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.72, step 7f. `scale-county-idle-species`: the NON-AGGREGATED twin of `scale-county-timeagg-year-toxics-idle` -- its selections unchanged (the gaseous species and air toxics at extended idle and auxiliary power, 29 pollutants each, and crankcase running, start and extended idle, 28, 28 and 27), for source types 21 and 62 on road types 1 and 4, over the same county database (`inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg.esm`), but at `<aggregateBy key=\"Hour\"/>` and `<outputtimestep value=\"Hour\"/>`: July 2020, weekdays, hours 7 and 8. MOVESOutput is 7,796 rows, 3,898 per hour, every one source type 62's: extended idle 1,450, APU 1,148 and its shore-power retag (process 93) 50, crankcase extended idle 1,250.\n\nWHAT IT DISCRIMINATES is what fails at extended idle, APU and crankcase extended idle at ANY aggregation, separated from what PreAggYEAR.sql's month collapse adds: the species chain at the two hotelling processes (`runspecchainedto`: CH4 and NMHC from THC, VOC and NMOG from NMHC, TOG from CH4 and NMOG, the toxics from VOC, NO/NO2/HONO from NOx, SO2 from energy), CrankcaseEmissionCalculator copying each of crankcase extended idle's 26 species from the FINISHED extended-idle species at its own `crankcaseRatio`, and CO2 Equivalent at crankcase extended idle from that process's own methane. AND ITS ABSENCES: crankcase running and start are selected without their parents and MOVES writes no row for them, nor an NH3 row at APU or crankcase extended idle.\n\n`n_outputRate` is bound to 3898, the (pollutant-process, cohort) pairs per (county, month, hour cell); `n_physicsRow` 21, the two source types' physics rows.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "single-county-domain",
      "road-type-axis",
      "off-network-idle",
      "hotelling-adjustment",
      "air-toxics",
      "hc-speciation",
      "nox-speciation",
      "crankcase"
    ]
  },
